{
 "_about": "Financial-services detection for transaction_intelligence. Categories carry a kind (leakage | adjacency) and an addressable flag. Patterns match against the cleaned merchant core (prefix/mask/date stripped, upper-cased) as whole tokens. Add client-specific providers under LocalFinancialServices in clients_config.json, same shape. review_ignore lists channel-noise strings (bill pay, online pmt) kept out of the review queue. SelfNames in clients_config.json (the client's OWN institution names) are excluded from every match and every queue -- internal transfers are not leakage.",
 "_source": "legacy analytics/financial_services/01_config.py (16 categories, 584 patterns) + three new buckets 2026-08-19; 2026-08-19 v2 after 1615's first run: generic tokens (MTG, AUTO FINANCE, INS PREM, 401K, LOAN PAYMT), missing issuers (Capital One, Chase, Citi, Synchrony, Comenity), mortgage servicers, MA insurers; US TREASURY/IRS moved to Tax & Accounting; v3 from 1615 run 2 (Ally/Honda payment forms, store cards, Citicard, Credit One, Fidelity FID BKG); v4 2026-08-19 from 1192's first run: TYPE:/ID: labels as lender-unknown generics (MTG*/STUDENT LN/BROKERAGE/CC PYMT/INS.PREM/LOAN), review_ignore for channel noise; v5 2026-09-18 from 1776's first run (#245): National General, Bristol West, Flexible Finance, US TREAS -- the matcher now normalises both sides",
